// EXPECT-ERROR: "hook" is expected by err-expect-absent.momo and nothing defines it - the call at err-expect-absent.momo:9 is reached, so the program must define "sub hook( u16 n )"
// EXPECT-AT: 6:1
// Reported once, at the expect, rather than at each call - and only because a
// call survives pruning. exptest has an expect whose calls are all pruned (§73).

expect sub hook( u16 n )

sub run {
  hook( 1 )
}

run()
